					<img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="Zach" width="80" height="30" />
				</a>
				<p class="site-footer__tagline">
					A junior full-stack developer with a solid background in UI, UX and frontend development. I help clients and companies build clean, modern websites, portfolios and web systems.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="site-footer__column">
				<h3 class="site-footer__heading">General Links</h3>
				<nav class="site-footer__nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
					<a href="/">Home</a>
					<a href="/about">About</a>
					<a href="/experiences">Experiences</a>
					<a href="/projects">Projects</a>
				</nav>
			</div>

			<div class="site-footer__column">
